    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "If an instrument contains a reference to the Centre or Director, it has effect from the commencement time as if the reference were a reference to the CEO.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "an instrument is in force immediately before the commencement time; and the instrument contains a reference to the Centre or to the Director;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "the instrument has effect from the commencement time as if the reference were a reference to the CEO.";
