    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "implies";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "However, if an instrument is in force immediately before the commencement time; and the instrument relates to assets or liabilities covered by item 2 or 3; and the instrument refers to the Centre or to the Director;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "an instrument is in force immediately before the commencement time; and the instrument relates to assets or liabilities covered by item 2 or 3; and the instrument refers to the Centre or to the Director;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "the reference is to be read as a reference to the Commonwealth as necessary to give effect to item 2 or 3, as the case requires.";
